# A work of body/gill (a gc:Teacher; ruling M5, ADR-0002 Revision 2). The Holding below is from ch. IV; the Arguments carry the evidence.

<source/gill-divine-right> a gc:SourceWork ;
    rdfs:label "John Gill, The Divine Right of Infant-Baptism, Examined and Disproved (London, 1749)"@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "London, 1749. ESTC T67557. Scan: archive.org bim_eighteenth-century_the-divine-right-of-infa_gill-john_1749 (leaf n = printed page + 3)." .

<source/gill-divine-right/4> a gc:SourceDivision ;
